    "text": "Following completion of (neo)adjuvant and locoregional therapy, 1 year of adjuvant olaparib is recommended for patients with gBRCA1/2m and HER2-negative, HRpositive EBC with multiple positive LNs after primary surgery or residual high-risk EBC after neoadjuvant ChT [I, A; ESMO-MCBS v1.1 score: A; ESCAT: I-A].",
